-- Many more places under each delivery provider (owner, 3 Nov 2026: "estimates for almost all places"). Every price is an estimate
-- with fare_confirmed false, on the same reasoning as V91: riders and Metros by distance from the shops, couriers by the older G4S
-- and Fargo tables, buses by their published flat rates. The stops along each Metro's route are judged from the areas it lists, so
-- staff should correct them in Settings > Delivery options. A place that already exists is left alone, so nothing staff set changes.
